{"nusach":"chabad","id":"candle_lighting","sections":[{"title":{"he":"הדלקת נרות שבת","en":"Shabbat Candle Lighting"},"segments":[{"key":"DqY6FkeqZT","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְיָ אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם אֲשֶׁר קִדְּ֒שָֽׁנוּ בְּמִצְוֹתָיו וְצִוָּֽנוּ לְהַדְלִיק נֵר שֶׁל שַׁבָּת קֹדֶשׁ:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who sanctified us with His commandments and commanded us to kindle the light of the holy Shabbos.","when":{"all":["shabbat"],"none":["yomTov","yomKippur"]}}]},{"title":{"he":"הדלקת נרות יום טוב","en":"Yom Tov Candle Lighting"},"segments":[{"key":"0CkrLNrvFb","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְיָ אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם אֲשֶׁר קִדְּ֒שָֽׁנוּ בְּמִצְוֹתָיו וְצִוָּֽנוּ לְהַדְלִיק נֵר שֶׁל יוֹם טוֹב:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who sanctified us with His commandments and commanded us to kindle the Yom Tov light.","when":{"all":["yomTov"],"none":["shabbat"]}},{"key":"YjC4h0w0OS","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְיָ אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם שֶׁהֶחֱיָֽנוּ וְקִיְּמָֽנוּ וְהִגִּיעָֽנוּ לַזְמַן הַזֶּה:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who has kept us alive and sustained us and brought us to this season.","when":{"all":["yomTov","shehecheyanu"],"none":["shabbat"]}}]},{"title":{"he":"הדלקת נרות שבת ויום טוב","en":"Shabbat and Yom Tov Candle Lighting"},"segments":[{"key":"WvAjYCYtvI","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְיָ אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם אֲשֶׁר קִדְּ֒שָֽׁנוּ בְּמִצְוֹתָיו וְצִוָּֽנוּ לְהַדְלִיק נֵר שֶׁל שַׁבָּת וְשֶׁל יוֹם טוֹב:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who sanctified us with His commandments and commanded us to kindle the Shabbos light and Yom Tov light.","when":{"all":["shabbat","yomTov"]}},{"key":"nZHIl1GkbX","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְיָ אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם שֶׁהֶחֱיָֽנוּ וְקִיְּמָֽנוּ וְהִגִּיעָֽנוּ לַזְמַן הַזֶּה:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who has kept 